Consumption Chain Priority: P0 (false positive repair success leads to residual issues) > P1 (confidence assessment) > P2 (reasoning process)
Brief Example:
  Input: issue_description="Character A is dead but still appears in later chapters", issue_evidence="Character A dies in Chapter 5", repaired_text="In Chapter 6, Character B recalls A's teachings"
  Output: {"issue_resolved": true, "confidence": 0.9, "reasoning": "Character A appears only in flashback form in the repaired text, consistent with the established death"}
